            "q": "Complete the dialogue with phrases from the box. There is one phrase that you don’t need. Could you explain what you mean Do you mean   For instance I’m not sure I understand   let me see what’s the word again Mr Khan   Welcome, Dimitar. Please, sit down. Dimitar   Thank you. Mr Khan   I have your CV somewhere … ____________________ ... ah, here it is. So, you’re here about the position in customer service? It says on your CV that you work well with people. ____________________ by that, please? Dimitar   Well, I’ve worked in shops in the past. ____________________, I spent three years at a large department store. I had to talk to customers a lot there and I really liked that. Mr Khan   I see. And it also says here that you are a self-starter. Dimitar   That’s right. Mr Khan ____________________ what you mean by that. Can you give me some examples? Dimitar   I often find the solutions to problems by myself. I don’t always need a manager to tell me what to do, so I’d say I’m   … ____________________? Proactive, that’s it –   yes, I’d call myself proactive. For example, when I was at the department store, I made a display of a new product to help it to sell better. That was all my own idea.: (1) Complete the sentence or answer the question.",
