            "q": "Read the article. For each underlined word or phrase, find a word or phrase later in the article that refers to the same thing. Do not include pronouns ( them ,   they , etc. in your answer). Budget Airlines Budget airlines are so called because they offer flights at low fares. Love them or hate them, we use them because they can save us a lot of money. But how are these companies able to offer such good prices? Well, they usually don’t land at and take off from the biggest airports in a country, which means that they pay less tax. Those main travel centres charge airlines high amounts to use their buildings. Secondly, budget airline s don’t provide food and drinks. However, hungry passengers can choose from a selection of snacks that are usually sold at high prices. I recently paid more than three times the usual price for a sandwich and a very small cup of coffee. Next time I take   an early flight, I’ll make sure I have breakfast at home. Finally, ticket prices are fixed, which means that the airline doesn’t offer refunds. If you have to cancel your flight, you won’t be able to get your money back   –   another lesson I’ve learn t the hard way! But it’s these business techniques that allow budget airlines to make so much money.: (1) Complete the sentence or answer the question.",
